397
00:19:00,403 --> 00:19:01,903
Senario 1: Prosedur Membuka Akaun Bank

398
00:19:01,903 --> 00:19:04,173
Ujian Mendengar

399
00:19:04,173 --> 00:19:06,740
Selamat datang.

400
00:19:06,740 --> 00:19:10,373
いらっしゃいませ = selamat datang

401
00:19:10,396 --> 00:19:13,744
Ujian Mendengar

402
00:19:13,744 --> 00:19:17,662
Ada yang boleh saya bantu hari ini?

403
00:19:17,662 --> 00:19:23,039
どうされましたか = apa yang membawa anda ke sini

404
00:19:23,062 --> 00:19:25,129
Ujian Mendengar

405
00:19:25,129 --> 00:19:27,429
Maaf.

406
00:19:30,685 --> 00:19:34,427
Ujian Mendengar

407
00:19:34,427 --> 00:19:38,824
Saya ingin membuka akaun bank.

408
00:19:38,824 --> 00:19:44,858
Vたい = mahu melakukan
銀行(ぎんこう) = bank
口座(こうざ) = akaun bank

409
00:19:44,881 --> 00:19:47,199
Ujian Mendengar

410
00:19:47,199 --> 00:19:49,833
Baiklah.

411
00:19:49,833 --> 00:19:53,508
かしこまりました = baiklah / sudah difahami

412
00:19:53,531 --> 00:19:56,398
Ujian Mendengar

413
00:19:56,398 --> 00:19:59,698
Akaun baru, ya?

414
00:19:59,698 --> 00:20:04,255
新(あたら)しい (baharu) ↔ 古(ふる)い (lama)

415
00:20:04,278 --> 00:20:07,311
Ujian Mendengar

416
00:20:07,311 --> 00:20:10,811
Ya, betul.

417
00:20:15,668 --> 00:20:19,401
Ujian Mendengar

418
00:20:19,401 --> 00:20:23,834
Adakah tuan/puan tinggal di Jepun?

419
00:20:23,834 --> 00:20:29,868
お + N = awalan hormat
お客様(きゃくさま) = pelanggan
お住(す)まい = tempat tinggal

420
00:20:29,891 --> 00:20:32,163
Ya.

421
00:20:32,186 --> 00:20:35,553
Ujian Mendengar

422
00:20:35,553 --> 00:20:39,486
Saya tinggal di Tokyo sejak bulan lalu.

423
00:20:39,486 --> 00:20:44,919
N + から = dari N
先月(せんげつ) (bulan lepas) ↔ 今月(こんげつ) (bulan ini)

424
00:20:44,942 --> 00:20:48,120
Ujian Mendengar

425
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:51,825
Adakah tuan/puan bekerja?

426
00:20:51,825 --> 00:20:56,925
Vていますか = adakah anda sedang melakukan...?
お仕事(しごと) = kerja

427
00:20:56,948 --> 00:20:59,015
Ya.

428
00:20:59,038 --> 00:21:01,138
Ujian Mendengar

429
00:21:01,138 --> 00:21:03,472
Saya seorang pekerja syarikat.

430
00:21:03,472 --> 00:21:06,738
N + です = Saya ialah N / Ini ialah N
会社員(かいしゃいん) = pekerja pejabat

431
00:21:06,761 --> 00:21:09,195
Ujian Mendengar

432
00:21:09,195 --> 00:21:11,973
Baiklah.

433
00:21:15,862 --> 00:21:20,730
Ujian Mendengar

434
00:21:20,730 --> 00:21:26,564
Untuk membuka akaun, anda memerlukan dokumen pengenalan diri.

435
00:21:26,564 --> 00:21:34,472
N + が必要(ひつよう)です = N diperlukan
開設(かいせつ) = pembukaan (akaun)
身分証明書(みぶんしょうめいしょ) = dokumen pengenalan

436
00:21:34,496 --> 00:21:37,996
Ujian Mendengar

437
00:21:37,996 --> 00:21:42,096
Dokumen pengenalan diri?

438
00:21:42,096 --> 00:21:47,729
N + ですか = Adakah ini N?

439
00:21:47,752 --> 00:21:49,552
Ya.

440
00:21:49,575 --> 00:21:53,475
Ujian Mendengar

441
00:21:53,475 --> 00:21:58,108
Adakah anda mempunyai kad penginapan atau pasport?

442
00:21:58,108 --> 00:22:04,408
N1 + や + N2 = N1 dan N2
在留(ざいりゅう)カード = kad pemastautin

443
00:22:04,431 --> 00:22:06,189
Ya.

444
00:22:06,213 --> 00:22:09,361
Ujian Mendengar

445
00:22:09,361 --> 00:22:13,061
Saya ada kad penginapan.

446
00:22:13,061 --> 00:22:18,129
Vています = mempunyai / memegang
持(も)つ = mempunyai / memegang

447
00:22:18,152 --> 00:22:20,252
Ujian Mendengar

448
00:22:20,252 --> 00:22:22,619
Terima kasih.

449
00:22:25,942 --> 00:22:29,453
Ujian Mendengar

450
00:22:29,453 --> 00:22:33,568
Tolong tunjukkan kad ini.

451
00:22:33,568 --> 00:22:39,235
Vてください = Tolong lakukan...
見(み)せる = menunjukkan

452
00:22:39,258 --> 00:22:41,124
Ya.

453
00:22:41,147 --> 00:22:43,181
Sila.

454
00:22:43,204 --> 00:22:45,516
Ujian Mendengar

455
00:22:45,516 --> 00:22:48,149
Saya akan sahkan.

456
00:22:48,149 --> 00:22:51,816
Vいたします = bentuk merendah untuk 'melakukan'
確認(かくにん) = pengesahan / pemeriksaan

457
00:22:51,839 --> 00:22:55,205
Ujian Mendengar

458
00:22:55,205 --> 00:22:59,141
Adakah anda mempunyai kad My Number?

459
00:22:59,141 --> 00:23:04,540
N + はありますか = Adakah anda mempunyai N?
マイナンバーカード = Kad Nombor Individu

460
00:23:04,564 --> 00:23:08,076
Ujian Mendengar

461
00:23:08,076 --> 00:23:12,195
Saya belum ada kad My Number.

462
00:23:12,195 --> 00:23:17,861
まだ + Vません = belum lagi melakukan
まだ = belum lagi

463
00:23:17,884 --> 00:23:20,151
Ujian Mendengar

464
00:23:20,151 --> 00:23:22,706
Oh, begitu.

465
00:23:26,320 --> 00:23:30,022
Ujian Mendengar

466
00:23:30,022 --> 00:23:34,379
Adakah anda mempunyai dokumen yang menunjukkan nombor My Number?

467
00:23:34,379 --> 00:23:40,412
V + N = [kata kerja] N
書類(しょるい) = dokumen

468
00:23:40,435 --> 00:23:43,469
Ujian Mendengar

469
00:23:43,469 --> 00:23:46,969
Saya ada resit penduduk.

470
00:23:46,969 --> 00:23:51,765
N + なら = jika ia adalah N
住民票(じゅうみんひょう) = sijil kediaman

471
00:23:51,788 --> 00:23:53,888
Ujian Mendengar

472
00:23:53,888 --> 00:23:56,230
Terima kasih.

473
00:23:59,553 --> 00:24:02,653
Ujian Mendengar

474
00:24:02,653 --> 00:24:06,245
Tolong berikan resit penduduk juga.

475
00:24:06,245 --> 00:24:11,224
N + もお願(ねが)いします = N juga, tolong
お願(ねが)いします = tolong

476
00:24:11,248 --> 00:24:14,224
Ujian Mendengar

477
00:24:14,224 --> 00:24:17,696
Baik. Ini dia.

478
00:24:22,506 --> 00:24:24,642
Ujian Mendengar

479
00:24:24,642 --> 00:24:27,075
Sudah disahkan.

480
00:24:30,473 --> 00:24:34,240
Ujian Mendengar

481
00:24:34,240 --> 00:24:38,673
Seterusnya, adakah anda mempunyai cap?

482
00:24:38,673 --> 00:24:44,743
ご + N = awalan sopan
次(つぎ) = seterusnya
印鑑(いんかん) = cap nama peribadi

483
00:24:44,767 --> 00:24:47,667
Ujian Mendengar

484
00:24:47,667 --> 00:24:51,003
Saya tidak ada cap.

485
00:24:51,003 --> 00:24:55,636
N + はありません = tidak mempunyai N

486
00:24:55,659 --> 00:24:58,597
Ujian Mendengar

487
00:24:58,597 --> 00:25:02,030
Tandatangan juga boleh.

488
00:25:02,030 --> 00:25:06,735
